{"id":"material","lemma":"material","pos":"adj","rank":1365,"glosses":["material"],"ipa":"/mateˈɾjal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"materiales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-material.wav","examples":[{"text":"Este material es asqueroso.","en":"This stuff is disgusting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803538"},{"text":"Una grúa eleva materiales de construcción pesados.","en":"A crane raises heavy construction materials.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692762"},{"text":"Este material se estira fácilmente.","en":"This material stretches easily.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594303"},{"text":"Los muebles hechos con materiales buenos se venden bien.","en":"Furniture made of good materials sells well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/694156"},{"text":"Voy a comprar material escolar.","en":"I'm going to buy school supplies.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/820396"}]}